{"id":"s301_18","name":"川普簽署對中 301 關稅備忘錄","date":"2018-03-22","cat":"policy","cat_name":"貿易與政策衝擊","note":"美中貿易戰開端","approx":false,"background":{"note":"美中貿易戰開端","external":{"background":"依 301 調查，美國對約 500 億美元中國進口品課 25% 關稅，貿易戰開端","notes":"三個數字性質不同：$50B 是 USTR 主張的「受損」與課稅對象規模，$7.2B 是淨福利損失，$51B 是買家毛成本。Amiti–Redding–Weinstein (CEPR DP13564, 2019) 估計到 2018 年底，美國每月多付關稅成本約 $30 億、無謂損失約 $14 億（已用論文全文核對；JEP 版本寫 $32 億）。美方 3/22 簽署時沿用 $50B 數字，7/6 起實際先對 $34B 加徵。這些是 2018 年關稅（含鋼鋁與後續波次）的結果，不全是 301 首批。報復關稅造成的美國農業損失未列入。","headline":{"usd_bn":51.0,"kind":"realized_loss","what":"同研究估計美國買家（消費者與進口企業）因進口價格上漲每年多付（未扣關稅收入與生產者利得）","source":"Fajgelbaum, Goldberg, Kennedy, Khandelwal, 'The Return to Protectionism', NBER WP 25638 (2019)","url":"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25638/w25638.pdf"},"impacts":[{"what":"USTR 跨部會小組估計中國不公平做法對美國每年造成的損害（以三年平均計；首批 25% 關稅涵蓋的進口額亦約 $50B）","usd_bn":50.0,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2018","source":"USTR, 'Section 301 Investigation Fact Sheet' (June 2018)","url":"https://ustr.gov/about-us/policy-offices/press-office/fact-sheets/2018/june/section-301-investigation-fact-sheet","source_quality":"primary","kind":"other"},{"what":"2018 年關稅戰對美國的年化總實質所得損失（扣除生產者利得與關稅收入後，占 GDP 0.04%）","usd_bn":7.2,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2019（NBER WP 25638）","source":"Fajgelbaum, Goldberg, Kennedy, Khandelwal, 'The Return to Protectionism', NBER WP 25638 (2019)","url":"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25638/w25638.pdf","source_quality":"primary","kind":"realized_loss"},{"what":"同研究估計美國買家（消費者與進口企業）因進口價格上漲每年多付（未扣關稅收入與生產者利得）","usd_bn":51.0,"range_bn":null,"as_of":"2019（NBER WP 25638）","source":"Fajgelbaum, Goldberg, Kennedy, Khandelwal, 'The Return to Protectionism', NBER WP 25638 (2019)","url":"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25638/w25638.pdf","source_quality":"primary","kind":"realized_loss"}]}},"pre":{"lag":null,"months":[{"m":"2017-03","n":9,"on":["dollar_dxy","carry_jpy","inflation_ust10","cycle_cuau","cycle_sox","cycle_twii","cycle_twd","